  [1mCleanup is only partly done.[0m The worktree is still at [38;5;153m.claude/worktrees/ratelimit[39m, on branch [38;5;153mworktree-ratelimit[39m:
  - I created it with Claude Code's own worktree tool, not under [38;5;153m.worktrees/[39m, so the skill counts it as the harness's to
    clean up.
  - I left it with "keep" so the merge could run from main, and the tool can't remove it now.
  - The branch can't be deleted while the worktree has it checked out.
