  To remove both, run:

  [38;5;153m! git worktree remove --force .claude/worktrees/ratelimit && git branch -d worktree-ratelimit[39m

  [38;5;153m--force[39m is needed only because of the [38;5;153m__pycache__/[39m folders inside the worktree. All its other files are committed and
  already on main.

